<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - منصة كِتَاب | للقراءة والشفغ الإلكتروني</title>
    
    <!-- Google Arabic Fonts (Cairo & Alex) -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 RTL CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.rtl.min.css">
    <!-- FontAwesome 6 -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #6366f1;
            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;
            --secondary-color: #06b6d4;
            --accent-color: #f59e0b;
            --dark-bg: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #1e293b;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Navbar Styling */
        .navbar-custom {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .navbar-brand span {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .nav-link {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #cbd5e1 !important;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {
            color: #ffffff !important;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* Gradient Text & Badges */
        .text-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #06b6d4 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .badge-paid {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .badge-free {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .badge-owned {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* Novel Cards */
        .novel-card {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            height: 100%;
        }

        .novel-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.18);
        }

        .novel-cover-container {
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 135%; /* Aspect Ratio 3:4 */
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #1e293b;
        }

        .novel-cover-img {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .novel-card:hover .novel-cover-img {
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }

        .novel-badge-category {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Main Content wrapper */
        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            color: #94a3b8;
            padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        footer h5 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark navbar-custom sticky-top py-2">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                <i class="fas fa-book-open text-info fs-3"></i>
                <span>كِتَاب</span> | منصة الروايات
            </a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarMain">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>

            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarMain">
                <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 align-items-lg-center">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                            <i class="fas fa-house ms-1"></i>الرئيسية
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" asp-controller="Novels" asp-action="Index">
                            <i class="fas fa-book-bookmark ms-1"></i>مكتبة الروايات
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- Search Bar -->
                <form class="d-flex me-3 my-2 my-lg-0" asp-controller="Novels" asp-action="Index" method="get">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <input type="text" name="search" class="form-control form-control-sm bg-dark text-white border-secondary rounded-end-pill px-3" placeholder="ابحث عن رواية أو كاتب..." value="@ViewBag.SearchQuery">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm rounded-start-pill px-3" type="submit">
                            <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>

                <!-- Auth Navigation -->
                <partial name="_LoginPartial" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Alert Notifications -->
    <div class="container mt-3">
        @if (TempData["SuccessMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show shadow-sm rounded-4 border-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2" role="alert">
                <i class="fas fa-circle-check fs-4"></i>
                <div>@TempData["SuccessMessage"]</div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close ms-auto me-0" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
            </div>
        }
        @if (TempData["ErrorMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show shadow-sm rounded-4 border-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2" role="alert">
                <i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation fs-4"></i>
                <div>@TempData["ErrorMessage"]</div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close ms-auto me-0" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
            </div>
        }
        @if (TempData["InfoMessage"] != null)
        {
            <div class="alert alert-info alert-dismissible fade show shadow-sm rounded-4 border-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2" role="alert">
                <i class="fas fa-circle-info fs-4"></i>
                <div>@TempData["InfoMessage"]</div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close ms-auto me-0" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
            </div>
        }
    </div>

    <!-- Main Body -->
    <main class="main-content">
        @RenderBody()
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <h5 class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-book-open text-info"></i> منصة كِتَاب
                    </h5>
                    <p class="small text-muted leading-relaxed">
                        المنصة العربية الأولى لقراءة الروايات والقصص الرقمية بأعلى جودة وتجربة قراءة سلسة ومحمية لكل عاشق للكتُب.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <h5 class="mb-3">روابط سريعة</h5>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled row g-2">
                        <li class="col-6"><a href="/Novels"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left ms-1 text-info fs-7"></i>استكشف الروايات</a></li>
                        <li class="col-6"><a href="/Account/Library"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left ms-1 text-info fs-7"></i>مكتبتي الخاّصة</a></li>
                        <li class="col-6"><a href="/Admin"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left ms-1 text-info fs-7"></i>لوحة الإدارة</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
                    <h5 class="mb-3">أمان المحتوى والدفع</h5>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-2"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved text-success me-1"></i> جميع المعاملات والفصول محمية ومقترنة بحسابك المعتمد.</p>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2 justify-content-lg-end">
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary p-2"><i class="fab fa-cc-visa fs-5"></i></span>
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary p-2"><i class="fab fa-cc-mastercard fs-5"></i></span>
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary p-2"><i class="fas fa-wallet fs-5"></i></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr class="my-4 border-secondary opacity-25">
            <div class="text-center small text-muted">
                جميع الحقوق محفوظة &copy; @DateTime.UtcNow.Year - منصة كِتَاب | MVP Production Ready
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 JS Bundle -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
